    <abstract>The Committee on Natural Resources, to whom was referred the bill (H.R. 2317) to provide for transfer of ownership of certain Federal lands in northern Nevada, to authorize the disposal of certain Federal lands in northern Nevada for economic development, to promote conservation in northern Nevada, and for other purposes, having considered the same, reports favorably thereon with an amendment and recommends that the bill as amended do pass.</abstract>
